{#
  ELEGANT — on Design's one page architecture (2026-10-05).

  The whole of what makes linen linen: typeface, weight, tracking, case and
  corner radius, from the README's theme table ("elegant | Cormorant Garamond
  | 500 | −0.01em | none | Geist | 0"). Layout, page set, spacing, colour
  roles and copy are `_v2/report.jinja2`, shared with atlas and harbor.

  WHAT THIS REPLACED
  786 lines of self-contained HTML and CSS rendering the nine-page set
  (contents, aerial and analysis pages; executive summary as its own page).
  Those pages are now the cover panel, the property-page photo plates and the
  range page, and a notes page carries the agent and the disclaimers.
#}
